  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Text Deduplication (MinHash)** by following direct mathematical principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\ndef nlp_text_deduplication_minhash(set_a: list, set_b: list, hash_coeffs: list) -> dict:\n    sa, sb = set(set_a), set(set_b)\n    tj = len(sa & sb) / len(sa | sb) if (sa | sb) else 0.0\n    siga = [min((a * x + b) % p for x in sa) for a, b, p in hash_coeffs]\n    sigb = [min((a * x + b) % p for x in sb) for a, b, p in hash_coeffs]\n    ej = sum(1 for ha, hb in zip(siga, sigb) if ha == hb) / len(hash_coeffs)\n    return {'true_jaccard': round(float(tj), 4), 'estimated_jaccard': round(float(ej), 4), 'signatures_a': siga, 'signatures_b': sigb}\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the size of the primary input.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
